WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.584
- I gotta meet this kid.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:06.840
- [Woman’s voice:] Hello?

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:07.882
- Ms. Dobson?

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:09.300
