00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:35.611
- [Crowd:] Oooh!

00:11:36.696 --> 00:11:37.738
- Is that Melo?

00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:40.866
- [Cheering]

00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:42.243
- Oh s--t! 

00:11:46.539 --> 00:11:48.082
- [Zack:] What does Hoodie Melo mean to you? 

00:11:48.332 --> 00:11:51.752
- [Anthony:] It’s a mentality. So Hoodie Season for me is, is all about 

00:11:52.002 --> 00:11:55.423
how you’re able to just buckle down, lock in on what you gotta lock in on.

00:11:55.631 --> 00:11:58.467
- [Unidentified coach:] Somebody or something in particular that you’re here for today?

00:11:58.926 --> 00:11:59.927
- I came out here for Zack.

00:12:00.594 --> 00:12:05.933
And the reason I came out here for Zack is because of his story, right?

00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:08.352
And, and knowing what he’s been through and knowing, 

00:12:08.936 --> 00:12:10.479
kinda, what his family been through.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.898
You’re still grindin’. You’re still pushin’.

00:12:13.357 --> 00:12:16.694
You still rockin’. You’re still here playin’ football.

00:12:16.694 --> 00:12:19.155
You coulda easily gave up, right?

00:12:19.155 --> 00:12:24.535
You coulda easily fell victim to that mentality of “Yo, my brother is gone,” like.

00:12:25.619 --> 00:12:29.415
Where your mind at is right now—that’s what I’m more interested in. 

00:12:29.415 --> 00:12:30.082
You know what I mean?

00:12:30.916 --> 00:12:32.585
- I don’t try to put it past me, but I just—

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:33.169
- Right.

00:12:33.169 --> 00:12:35.838
- try to put it in the back of my mind—don’t let it really distract me and get me. 

00:12:35.838 --> 00:12:36.714
I just keep goin’.

00:12:36.714 --> 00:12:37.214
- Right.

00:12:37.214 --> 00:12:38.924
- Just keep pushin’. Keep doin’ it for him.

00:12:38.924 --> 00:12:40.217
Cuz then I got a son now so—

00:12:40.217 --> 00:12:40.760
- Oh, so that’s—

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:44.722
- He’s like—I got, I got another reason to do it—for him as well. 

00:12:44.847 --> 00:12:47.099
- That’s almost like a blessing from a tragedy.

00:12:47.266 --> 00:12:47.600
- Yeah.

00:12:47.641 --> 00:12:49.894
-But you keep doing whatchu doing on the football field.

00:12:49.894 --> 00:12:52.605
Cuz like I said in there, all that hard work paid off. 

00:12:52.605 --> 00:12:54.398
Like, everybody see how hard you work.

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:56.066
- I appreciate that, for real.

00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:56.650
- Absolutely.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:57.276
- It’s love.

00:12:57.276 --> 00:12:57.943
- Of course.

00:12:58.235 --> 00:12:59.069
- That s--t crazy.

00:12:59.445 --> 00:13:03.032
- That conversation was more than just being an athlete.

00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:08.662
What’s real is: This is not about basketball. It’s more than football.

00:13:08.662 --> 00:13:11.749
It’s about you losing your brother, like, how do you respond to that?

00:13:12.249 --> 00:13:15.586
Life is bigger than sports, but sports bring us together.

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:17.797
So when we give what we can to each other,

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:19.882
when we commit to each other,

00:13:20.508 --> 00:13:21.926
when we struggle together,

00:13:22.426 --> 00:13:23.427
we win together.

00:13:24.345 --> 00:13:25.346
This is what real is.

00:13:26.806 --> 00:13:28.808
- I’m just livin’ life. I’m just livin’ life. 

00:13:29.433 --> 00:13:30.184
Tryna make it.

00:13:31.143 --> 00:13:32.978
- [Cheering]

00:13:32.978 --> 00:13:35.105
- [Announcer:] Dobson, sweepin’ around.

00:13:35.439 --> 00:13:36.941
Dobson, in the end zone!

00:13:37.233 --> 00:13:41.278
The freshman scores for the first time in his career! 

00:13:41.487 --> 00:13:44.114
- [Zack:] When I do score, I just smile. It's Zaevion.

00:13:44.532 --> 00:13:45.950
It's Zaevion. Every time.

00:13:47.743 --> 00:13:49.703
Everybody comin’ up, “So you friends with Carmelo?!”

00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:51.956
And I’m like, “Man, I did not know about this!”

00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:53.040
They like, “Oh, you lyin’.”

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.625
“I’m serious! I didn’t know about it!”

00:13:54.792 --> 00:13:55.960
They talkin’ ‘bout, “Who comin’ next?

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.628
Who comin’ next, Zack? Who comin’ next?”

00:13:57.628 --> 00:13:59.588
They say, “Who next—LeBron? KD?”

00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:02.591
He took time out of his day. Came to see me and talk to me.

00:14:02.842 --> 00:14:04.093
And that’s, that’s love. That’s mad love. 

00:14:04.761 --> 00:14:07.111
- This is Carmelo Anthony. Thanks for watching.

